    "@releasekit/version": "\n\n### New:\n- Standing PR preview now includes merge prediction.\n\n### Documentation:\n- Documentation has been improved.\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/goosewobbler/releasekit/compare/releasekit-version-v0.20.0...releasekit-version-v0.21.0\n\n",
